# Math content seam

This repo is the S3 Maths dashboard inside a UniPlus iframe. Teachers may add quiz questions freely. Tracker wiring stays frozen.

## Do this

Edit only the question banks:

- `dashboard/topics/percentage/percentage-quiz-data.js`
- `dashboard/topics/factorization/factorization-quiz-data.js`
- `dashboard/topics/inequality/inequality-quiz-data.js`
- `dashboard/topics/probability/probability-quiz-data.js`
- `dashboard/topics/area_volume/area-volume-quiz-data.js`

Keep the existing shape: `{ id, type: "mc", prompt, choices, answer }` where `answer` is a 0-based index. New questions get a new `id`. Never reuse a published `id`.

After edits run `node dashboard/scripts/test-math-quiz-tracker.cjs`.

## Stop and ask the technical owner if the task needs

`*-quiz.js` runners, `dashboard/shared/math-quiz-tracker.js`, `uni-tracker.js`, `postMessage`, `uniplus:*` payloads, `quizId`, `questionId` prefixes (`pct-q`, `fac-q`, `ineq-q`, `prob-q`, `av-q`), `functions/`, `.github/`, Supabase, or `fetch`.

Do not convert choices to `{ key: "A", text }` or answers to `"B"`. That would change rows in `math_quiz_attempts`.
